WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:27.000
[Instrumental Intro]

00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:32.500
I see you move, I see your style

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:38.000
That easy charm, that practiced smile

00:00:41.788 --> 00:00:48.500
You think you're clever, think you're slick

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:56.000
You've got your whole routine down to a trick

00:00:56.500 --> 00:01:00.500
You see a quiet, gentle soul

00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:04.200
Another prize to make you whole

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:09.500
But I've seen that look in someone's eyes before

00:01:11.408 --> 00:01:18.500
And I won't let you walk through that door

00:01:18.673 --> 00:01:22.800
I know your game, I know your kind

00:01:22.900 --> 00:01:26.800
The little traps you leave behind

00:01:26.900 --> 00:01:30.500
You think she's weak, a fragile prey

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:34.514
But you're not taking her away

00:01:34.594 --> 00:01:40.200
I've walked through fire, I've paid the cost

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:44.500
And I won't let another light be lost

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:49.000
Not her. Not today.

00:01:49.500 --> 00:02:31.000
[Instrumental Break]

00:02:31.596 --> 00:02:35.200
Brother, listen, something's wrong

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:39.200
We've been here for far too long

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:42.500
His eyes are cold, his words are cheap

00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:46.107
A poisoned promise he can't keep

00:02:46.348 --> 00:02:51.500
Just take my hand, let's turn and run

00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:57.500
Before his wicked game is won

00:03:06.742 --> 00:03:24.000
I know your game, I know your kind

00:03:30.458 --> 00:03:36.442
The little traps you leave behind

00:03:37.603 --> 00:03:40.685
You think she's weak, a fragile prey

00:03:40.706 --> 00:03:46.530
But you're not taking her away

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:52.500
I've walked through fire, I've paid the cost

00:03:52.600 --> 00:03:57.500
And I won't let another light be lost

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:04.500
Not her. Not today.

00:04:08.005 --> 00:04:14.731
Not her!

00:04:15.372 --> 00:04:20.000
Not today!

00:04:21.500 --> 00:04:24.500
Not ever again!
